1	## Mandatory HTML Skeleton
2	
3	**EVERY visualization MUST start from this skeleton.** Copy it, then add content. This gives you themes, print styles, Inter font, animations, menu, and hover effects — all working out of the box.
4	
5	**Design philosophy: CSS-first, JS-minimal.** Animations use CSS `@keyframes` and `transition` (always reliable). JavaScript is only for: menu, theme toggle, scroll observer, number counters, and PNG download. No animation libraries required.
6	
7	```html
8	<!DOCTYPE html>
9	<html lang="en" class="theme-dark">
10	<head>
11	  <meta charset="UTF-8">
12	  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
13	  <title>YOUR TITLE HERE</title>
14	  <!-- fonts pre-installed at /app/libs/fonts/ -->
15	  <link href="/app/libs/fonts/inter.css" rel="stylesheet">
16	  <!-- ADD LANGUAGE FONTS IF NEEDED: e.g. Noto Sans KR for Korean, Noto Sans JP for Japanese -->
17	  <!-- <link href="/app/libs/fonts/noto-sans-kr.css" rel="stylesheet"> -->
18	  <!-- ADD CDN LIBRARIES HERE (Chart.js, Mermaid, etc.) -->
19	  <script src="/app/libs/html-to-image.js"></script>
20	  <style>
21	    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
22	    :root { interpolate-size: allow-keywords; } /* Enable smooth height:auto transitions (Chrome 129+) */
23	
24	    /* ===== THEMES (class-based ONLY — no @media prefers-color-scheme) ===== */
25	    html.theme-dark {
26	      --bg: #0A0A0A; --surface: #141414; --surface-hover: #1C1C1C;
27	      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
28	      --text: #EDEDED; --text-secondary: #888;
29	      --accent: #3b82f6; --accent-secondary: #8b5cf6;
30	      --positive: #10b981; --negative: #f43f5e; --warning: #f59e0b;
31	    }
32	    html.theme-light {
33	      --bg: #FAFAF9; --surface: #FFFFFF; --surface-hover: #F5F5F4;
34	      --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
35	      --text: #0f172a; --text-secondary: #64748b;
36	      --accent: #2563eb; --accent-secondary: #7c3aed;
37	      --positive: #059669; --negative: #e11d48; --warning: #d97706;
38	    }
